  <Strings>
    <Section>entry</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2377</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3c00000f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ただいま、
お父さん、お母さん。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mãe, pai! Cheguei!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2399</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3c000010</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おお、クレア、&lt;Veigue&gt;……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ora, se não são Claire
e &lt;Veigue&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2427</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3c000011</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……ただいま、
おじさん、おばさん。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tia, tio, cheguei.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2458</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3c000012</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……お帰りなさい。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Bem-vindos de volta.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2706</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3c00006e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よ、よお、&lt;Veigue&gt;。
帰ってたのか……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O-Oi, &lt;Veigue&gt;.
Então você voltou!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2727</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3c00006f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>何か、うちに用事か？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Precisa de alguma coisa?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2758</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3c000070</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いや……別に……
なあ……この香り……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Na verdade não... Ei,
estou sentindo um cheiro...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2787</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3c000071</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、ポプラおばさんの
ピーチパイの香りだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>É, a Tia Poplar assou
umas tortas de pêssego.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2818</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3c000072</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱりな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eu sabia...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2847</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3c000073</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>食べていったらどうだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Quer comer um pouco?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2878</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>3c000074</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>えっ、あ、いや……俺はいいや……
ほら、なんとなく、な？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, n-não... Tô de boa. Seria
meio, sabe... você sabe.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s0-0</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おう、&lt;Veigue&gt;！
この景色、この空気……
最高だな！
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ei, &lt;Veigue&gt;! O cenário, o clima...
Tá tudo perfeito aqui!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2146</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さ、行って来いよ。
村の人の話を聞きに……
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Beleza, vamos nessa.
Quero falar com o pessoal daqui...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Literally "OK, let's go. To hear what the villagers have to say..."</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s0-1</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1431</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今、クレアちゃんが来たけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Claire voltou agora...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1453</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>助かったんかいのう？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Então ela foi salva, é?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1478</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>スールズは寒い地方だが、
作物には恵まれているのじゃ。
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mesmo Sulz estando numa região
fria, somos abençoados com
boas colheitas.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1500</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>南のボーダリア地方、特に砂漠の方は
過酷な環境らしいのう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A região sul de Bordalia parece
ser só deserto inóspito...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1550</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クレアちゃんがさらわれて、
マルコさんも気の毒に……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Claire foi sequestrada,
pobre Marco...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、こんな時、
頼りの&lt;Veigue&gt;がいてくれて、
本当によかったのう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mas é bom que ele possa contar
com &lt;Veigue&gt; numa hora dessas...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1635</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ポプラおばさんの言う事も
一理あるわ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A Sra. Poplar tem razão.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1657</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヒューマのじいさんと
仲良くしとったが、金輪際、
口は利かんと決めたんじゃ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Desde que briguei com aquele velho
Huma, não falo mais com nenhum
Huma nem que a vida dependa disso.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1682</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヒューマとは口を利かんと
決めたんじゃ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Não vou falar com Huma...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1745</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Veigue&gt;か……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Veigue&gt;, hein...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1767</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ワシはどうして……
何を……あんなにムキになって
ヒューマの事を責めておったのじゃ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Por que fiz aquilo...?
O que me deixou tão na defensiva
que comecei a condenar
os Huma...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1792</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ワシはどうして……
何を……あんなにムキになって
ヒューマの事を責めておったのじゃ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Por que fiz aquilo...?
O que me deixou tão na defensiva
que comecei a condenar
os Huma...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1814</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだったんじゃ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mas o que foi tudo aquilo...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3155</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ううむ……
ヒューマと会うのは
気が進まんな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hum... Não tenho vontade de
ficar com esses Huma...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、前はヒューマのじいさんと
一緒に、ここを耕してただろう？
友達だったじゃないか。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mas você não cultivava esses
campos com um velho Huma?
Não eram amigos?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3206</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>前はそうだったさ。
うまくやれるなら、そうしたい。
だが、もうこうなってしまっては……
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Éramos, sim. E, se desse, eu
queria ser amigo dele de novo.
Mas do jeito que tá agora...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3237</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>仲良くやりたいのは
きっと相手も同じです。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tenho certeza de que ele também
quer voltar a ser seu amigo.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3268</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それを信じて、
顔を出してみませんか？
……ね？
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Se acredita nisso, poderia
aparecer na festa, não é?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1882</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>仲良くしたいのは相手も同じ……
ふーむ……
少し考えさせてくれ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Então nós dois queremos
fazer as pazes de novo...
Hum... Vou pensar...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>生まれてこの方、
あんな地鳴りは
聞いた事がない。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Em todos os meus anos de vida,
nunca ouvi a terra gritar
daquele jeito.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1964</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おまえはどうじゃ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>E você?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ワシも聞いた事ないな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eu também não.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2018</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれは一体……
何じゃったのじゃろな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Que será que foi aquilo...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2064</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いつでもスールズに
戻って来るんじゃぞ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Volte a Sulz quando quiser.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2089</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こんな田舎にお客さんかい。
珍しいの。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Raramente recebemos visitas
aqui no meio do nada.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s0-2</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1057</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クレアが氷の中から
出られたみたいだの。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Parece que Claire finalmente
saiu do gelo.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1079</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よかった、よかった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Que maravilha...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1142</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>スールズはワシが守る！
安心して行ってこい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eu protejo Sulz!
Podem partir sem
preocupação!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1177</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>皆さん、
&lt;Veigue&gt;の事、頼みますぞ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Confio a vocês o cuidado
de &lt;Veigue&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1202</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お二人とも、
&lt;Veigue&gt;の事、頼みますぞ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Confio a vocês dois o cuidado
de &lt;Veigue&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1252</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>地鳴りが敵じゃ、
ワシの剣の腕も
まったく歯が立たぬ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Se esse rugido vem de um inimigo,
não acho que meu braço da espada
vai aguentar.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1274</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>逃げるが勝ちって
事もあるからな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Quem foge hoje luta amanhã,
dizem por aí.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうじゃ、&lt;Veigue&gt;。
ちゃんと剣の稽古は
しておるか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>E então, &lt;Veigue&gt;, tem
treinado com a espada?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1345</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>皆さん、
ワシの剣の手ほどきを
受けんかね。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Bem, amigos, querem que eu
lhes ensine os caminhos
da espada?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s2-0</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4862</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;休憩しますか？
　はい　
　いいえ　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;Quer descansar?
Sim
Não</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
